* __[BBK04]__ Christoph Benzmüller, Chad E. Brown, and Michael Kohlhase. Higher-order semantics and extensionality. _The Journal of Symbolic Logic_, 69(4):1027–1088, 2004.
* __[BBT+21]__ Alexander Bentkamp, Jasmin Blanchette, Sophie Tourret, Petar Vukmirović, and Uwe Waldmann. Superposition with lambdas. _Journal of Automated Reasoning_, 65(7):893–940, 2021.
